firefox-addons:871621.summary:
This extension summarizes privacy policies automatically. 
Instructions on how to use the add-on: 
Install the add-on on firefox browser;
open the web page which contains the privacy policies you would like to check;
Click on "Start";

firefox-addons:871621.description:
Instructions on how to use and test the add-on: 
Install the add-on on firefox browser;
open the web page which contains the privacy policies you would like to check;
Click on "Start";
The colors of icons will indicate the safety level for different factors.
Corresponding detailed explanation will appear when hovering over each colored icon.

bluejetty:00081951:ios.description:
Welcome to "Merge Mine Mania", an idle mining train simulator! Embark on a unique railroad journey where you will have to master the art of managing transport and mining resources. In this addicting game, you will have to build a huge railroad empire by expanding your train and replenishing it with precious items: various rocks, minerals, mushrooms. Start by chopping down trees to clear land and gather the necessary materials. Then dive into the world of mining and building railway station from scratch.
Would you like to become a real master at driving a miner train? Upgrade your train by combining railroad carriages with each other to enhance its power. Clear road segments, collect various resources and lay new intricate railroad tracks through beautiful landscapes, providing your transport with new possibilities. Expand and modernize the railway empire!
"Merge Mine Mania" won't allow you to get bored as it perfectly combines hypercasual idler and rail road simulator with merge mechanics. Hurry up and dive into the rolling world of trains, endless resources and exploration. Become an essential train driver and miner!
"Merge Mine Mania" simulator features:
- Unlimited building and railroad station evolution;
- Train Upgrade: assemble your transport from different parts, merge identical carriages with each other;
- Resource Gathering: Collect various resources to clear land for building;
- Endless Railway: expand the railroad tracks and build your empire;
- Vivid graphics: get the most fun out of the detailed graphics.
Explore new territories, create your own railway station empire, coordinate and transport trains according to your own simulation strategy! If you love idle miner games and rail road simulators, you are sure to fall in love with "Merge Mine Mania"!

